{"event_type":"review","id":"613993b0a0b43e68cf459b5f9be82d9c0045944d57721a299c1dd410a4a9c2b5","occurred_at":"2026-11-14T19:11:14Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/727da234153281b3815b7054665c2186854cd22c85aebb048d13c2455dca2a17","sha256":"727da234153281b3815b7054665c2186854cd22c85aebb048d13c2455dca2a17"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/dc218f6d779bdabeca026b3c2f50b384cffe2c33095d213fa4111469c5397f1f","sha256":"dc218f6d779bdabeca026b3c2f50b384cffe2c33095d213fa4111469c5397f1f"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/d514db2d593e4c85fa57384d855c7bea18ed277ed99de3011cdd1dbf1a1b7a98","sha256":"d514db2d593e4c85fa57384d855c7bea18ed277ed99de3011cdd1dbf1a1b7a98"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/f2cd7d02fbca4c3956e7fbc8061ff771f61374136d3acb96dc0cb5c21df05aa5","sha256":"f2cd7d02fbca4c3956e7fbc8061ff771f61374136d3acb96dc0cb5c21df05aa5"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/89e2733c5e147ba50a8f579f20fcd8e8873ff77e0f5eb4cf868bc47fd6570352","sha256":"89e2733c5e147ba50a8f579f20fcd8e8873ff77e0f5eb4cf868bc47fd6570352"}],"attempt_id":"eb75c4ed07c048b71f9c9f6c34c6e9ebf0cc3d3a05aa55117a0b40c59dc7d2f6:0:1","base":"4251d651b40c851b921da31c4975d8c1a78fda29","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"affea7d3ba35ed04889da3846dab9ce111a4647c","body":"**Recover publication-owned halts even when the failure marker is missing.**\n\nIf `workerServices` fails before request creation, `recordFailure` can halt the queue even when its marker write fails. For example, temporary `backfill` directory permissions can prevent marker creation while the queue remains writable.\n\nAfter repair, this guard returns `idle` because the request, pending records, and failure marker are absent. Subsequent `runPublish` calls never clear the persisted publication halt.\n\nMake a publication-owned queue halt trigger reconciliation even without the filesystem marker. See `src/ops/crq/publishRun.ts:833-861`.","id":"d77a290ca02c466c243df3c79c50cbe3b3f7a5894b24c65329686559d69b3992","intervals":[[428,428]],"path":"src/ops/crq/publishRun.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Recover publication-owned halts even when the failure marker is missing."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"87815fbca68a488c258b39bee8fa4e712fdaf2d8","body":"**Pass the full queue item to `remediationFixed`.**\n\nAt `src/ops/crq/queueCapability.ts:401`, `item` comes from `receiptStatus`, which omits `subject`. `remediationFixed` compares the remediation subject and receipt source with `item.subject`. Both comparisons fail for valid evidence because `item.subject` is undefined.\n\nConsequently, status always reports `fixed: false` when `projectFixed` is enabled. Find the mapped queue item and pass that item to `remediationFixed`.","id":"abf3586a29c97eaf54d853e722344b791ddb397ace37df761753ac301eff74eb","intervals":[[454,455]],"path":"src/ops/crq/queueCapability.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Pass the full queue item to `remediationFixed`."}],"head":"f86445b6068941e8773aeb5c8d04ae14419f5a17","head_tree":"ff441c47f135816927d2c105b0555b66502df3d8","input_scope":[{"blob":"affea7d3ba35ed04889da3846dab9ce111a4647c","intervals":[[1,884]],"path":"src/ops/crq/publishRun.ts"},{"blob":"87815fbca68a488c258b39bee8fa4e712fdaf2d8","intervals":[[1,1113]],"path":"src/ops/crq/queueCapability.ts"},{"blob":"11471c50090418bb4a8296fb8b48fa4d59bff5dd","intervals":[[1,62]],"path":"src/ops/crq/registry.ts"},{"blob":"969452a634be772cdd4a5856d876817baa3b1840","intervals":[[1,1268]],"path":"src/ops/crq/statusWriter.ts"}],"job_id":"eb75c4ed07c048b71f9c9f6c34c6e9ebf0cc3d3a05aa55117a0b40c59dc7d2f6:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"p